{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":490123,"name":"Anmol Ratan","username":"Anmol_Ratan","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/a/3e96dc/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-13T15:06:46.576Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-490123-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-490123-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-490123-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-490123-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot desktop stays on “Reconnecting to your computer… Retrying…” and “No saved Bots yet.” Cannot create or load Bots. Stuck for 2 weeks.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-490123-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-490123-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOpen Grok Bot desktop.\u003cbr\u003e\nSign in as Anmol Ratan.\u003cbr\u003e\nApp never attaches the Agent Computer.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-490123-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-490123-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCloud computer connects and Bots load.\u003cbr\u003e\nScreenshots: Upload the screenshot you sent.\u003cbr\u003e\nOperating System: Windows 10/11\u003cbr\u003e\nVersion Information: Check Help / About in the app and paste it. If unknown: latest Grok Bot for Windows.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-490123-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-490123-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScreenshots / Screen Recordings\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/b/5/b5ca1f89adfbb77d1008c92a289385d910fd2751.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/pWbt5divlnnQlkdaFcde25LNgjL.png?dl=1\" title=\"Screenshot 2026-09-13 202707.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/b/5/b5ca1f89adfbb77d1008c92a289385d910fd2751_2_689x500.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-09-13 202707.png\" data-base62-sha1=\"pWbt5divlnnQlkdaFcde25LNgjL\" width=\"689\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/b/5/b5ca1f89adfbb77d1008c92a289385d910fd2751_2_689x500.png, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/b/5/b5ca1f89adfbb77d1008c92a289385d910fd2751_2_1033x750.png 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/b/5/b5ca1f89adfbb77d1008c92a289385d910fd2751.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"0C0C0C\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eScreenshot 2026-09-13 202707.png\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e1034×750 12.6 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-490123-operating-system-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-490123-operating-system-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWindows 10/11\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-490123-version-information-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-490123-version-information-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot: 0.20.0\u003cbr\u003e\nRelease Track: stable\u003cbr\u003e\nOS: darwin\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-490123-additional-information-8\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-490123-additional-information-8\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eAdditional Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTried: Retry, full quit, sign out/in, uninstall/reinstall, phone hotspot, VPN/antivirus off, mobile app sync, Privacy Mode on \u003ca href=\"http://cursor.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003ecursor.com\u003c/a\u003e, Update/Recover. No change. Please rebuild the Agent Computer on the backend.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-490123-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-9\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-490123-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-9\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo - Cursor works, but with this issue\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2026-09-13T15:56:46.668Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":1,"reads":7,"readers_count":6,"score":21.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":171514,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-stuck-on-reconnecting-for-2-weeks-anmol-ratan","display_username":"Anmol Ratan","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"http://cursor.com","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"AI Coding Agent for Building Ambitious Software | Cursor","clicks":0}],"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":1}],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":137597,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-stuck-on-reconnecting-for-2-weeks-anmol-ratan/171514/1","reactions":[{"id":"+1","type":"emoji","count":1}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":1,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":true,"can_vote":false},{"id":490138,"name":"Dean Rie","username":"deanrie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-13T15:56:27.270Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey, thanks for the detailed report. Good news first: your Agent Computer is alive on our side, and all Bots are still there. Nothing is lost.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat’s happening: the app can reach our servers fine, but your network can’t resolve the address (DNS) that the app uses to connect specifically to the Agent Computer. This check happens on your network side, so reinstalling, Reset, signing out and back in, and Privacy Mode wouldn’t change anything. Rebuilding the computer on the backend won’t help either: a new computer gets an address in the same zone that your resolver can’t resolve. So for now, don’t press Reset or Recover. Each click just rebuilds the computer for no reason.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat to try:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFully close Grok Bot right click the tray icon near the clock, then Quit.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWindows Settings \u0026gt; Network and internet \u0026gt; pick your connection Wi-Fi or Ethernet.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNext to DNS server assignment click Edit \u0026gt; Manual \u0026gt; enable IPv4 \u0026gt; Preferred DNS: \u003ccode\u003e1.1.1.1\u003c/code\u003e, Alternate DNS: \u003ccode\u003e8.8.8.8\u003c/code\u003e \u0026gt; Save.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCheck Settings \u0026gt; Apps \u0026gt; Installed apps. If Grok Bot is installed twice, uninstall the older one and keep only the latest version.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLaunch Grok Bot again and give it 15 to 20 minutes.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuick double-check: connect your PC to your phone hotspot on a different carrier not Jio and open Grok Bot. If it connects there, the issue is your usual network DNS.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLet me know how it goes. If it still doesn’t connect after step 5, tell me and we’ll dig deeper.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":5,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2026-09-13T15:56:27.270Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":4,"readers_count":3,"score":5.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":171514,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-stuck-on-reconnecting-for-2-weeks-anmol-ratan","display_username":"Dean Rie","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":750,"hidden":false,"trust_level":4,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-stuck-on-reconnecting-for-2-weeks-anmol-ratan/171514/5","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":true,"topic_accepted_answer":true},{"id":490141,"name":"Anmol Ratan","username":"Anmol_Ratan","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/a/3e96dc/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-13T16:19:42.308Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eThanks — that fixed it.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFully quit Grok Bot, set DNS to 1.1.1.1 / 8.8.8.8, confirmed a single install, then left the app open. It connected after a few minutes.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAppreciate the help.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":7,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2026-09-13T16:19:42.308Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":5,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":4,"readers_count":3,"score":0.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":171514,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-stuck-on-reconnecting-for-2-weeks-anmol-ratan","display_username":"Anmol Ratan","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"reply_to_user":{"id":750,"username":"deanrie","name":"Dean Rie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png"},"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":137597,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-stuck-on-reconnecting-for-2-weeks-anmol-ratan/171514/7","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":true}],"stream":[490123,490138,490141]},"timeline_lookup":[[1,0]],"suggested_topics":[],"tags":[{"id":416,"name":"grok-bot","slug":"grok-bot"},{"id":408,"name":"networking","slug":"networking"}],"tags_descriptions":{},"fancy_title":"Grok Bot stuck on Reconnecting for 2 weeks — Anmol Ratan","id":171514,"title":"Grok Bot stuck on Reconnecting for 2 weeks — Anmol Ratan","posts_count":3,"created_at":"2026-09-13T15:06:46.543Z","views":30,"reply_count":1,"like_count":1,"last_posted_at":"2026-09-13T16:19:42.308Z","visible":true,"closed":false,"archived":false,"has_summary":false,"archetype":"regular","slug":"grok-bot-stuck-on-reconnecting-for-2-w